"App 仅创建 OAuth 会话、打开授权页、轮询状态和按需转交回调地址。授权令牌不会写入 App 偏好设置或日志；插件与当前目标 CLIProxyAPI 决定凭证的实际存储位置。" = "The app simply creates an OAuth session, opens the authorization page, polls for status, and forwards the callback address as needed. Authorization tokens are not written to App preferences or logs; the plugin and the current target CLIProxyAPI determine where the credentials are actually stored.";
"App 会停止当前目标服务并删除本机保存的 CPA / CPAMP 管理密钥，但不会删除目标目录、认证文件或远程部署文件。之后可以选择另一个本机或 VPS 目标。" = "The app will stop the current target service and delete the locally saved CPA/CPAMP management keys, but will not delete the target directory, certification files, or remote deployment files. You can then choose another local or VPS destination.";
"App 会先停止由本次部署创建的进程或 Compose 服务，再把失败部署文件和日志移动到目标目录的 backups/failed-*，不会直接删除。" = "The App will first stop the process or Compose service created by this deployment, and then move the failed deployment files and logs to backups/failed-* in the target directory, and will not delete them directly.";
