"这会从当前目标的插件目录移除插件文件，并删除对应的 plugins.configs 配置。若插件正在运行，CLIProxyAPI 可能要求先重启服务。" = "This will remove the plugin files from the current target's plugins directory and delete the corresponding plugins.configs configuration. If the plugin is running, CLIProxyAPI may require the service to be restarted first.";
"这会用当前 JSON 替换目标上的插件配置。若删除原有字段，CLIProxyAPI 会按新的对象保存并重载对应配置。" = "This replaces the plugin configuration on the target with the current JSON. If the original field is deleted, CLIProxyAPI will save and reload the corresponding configuration as a new object.";
"这会直接替换当前目标的 config.yaml。错误配置可能导致 CLIProxyAPI 无法启动；建议先导出一份备份。" = "This directly replaces the current target's config.yaml. Incorrect configuration may cause CLIProxyAPI to fail to start; it is recommended to export a backup first.";
"这会调用 CLIProxyAPI 的 reset-quota，清除该 auth_index 的运行时配额状态。Provider 真实额度不会被修改。" = "This calls CLIProxyAPI's reset-quota, clearing the runtime quota state for that auth_index. The provider's actual quota will not be modified.";
"这只会在当前 CPAMP 的本地监控数据库中补齐认证聚合与计价，不会请求 Provider，也不会修改认证文件或密钥。" = "This will only complete the certification aggregation and pricing in the current CPAMP's local monitoring database, without requesting the Provider or modifying the certification files or keys.";
"这只会清空当前目标 CLIProxyAPI 的运行日志，不会删除认证文件、配置或部署目录。" = "This will only clear the run log of the current target CLIProxyAPI and will not delete the authentication files, configuration or deployment directories.";
"这只删除 CPAMP 本地成本估算条目，不会停用认证文件、修改 Provider、删除请求历史或改变实际账单。" = "This only removes the CPAMP local cost estimate entry and does not deactivate the certification file, modify the provider, delete the request history, or change the actual bill.";
"这是 CLIProxyAPI 的完整配置入口" = "This is the complete configuration entry of CLIProxyAPI";
"这是设备授权流程。打开授权页并完成确认后，App 会每 3 秒查询目标服务的授权状态。" = "This is the device authorization process. After opening the authorization page and completing the confirmation, the App will query the authorization status of the target service every 3 seconds.";
"这次巡检可能按 CPAMP 当前策略修改认证文件状态。" = "This inspection may modify the certification file status according to the current CPAMP policy.";
"这里只读取 CPAMP 已保存的巡检历史、结果与日志。只有在你确认“开始巡检”后，目标服务才会使用认证文件向 Codex / xAI 等 Provider 进行真实健康检查。" = "Only the inspection history, results and logs saved by CPAMP are read here. Only after you confirm \"Start Inspection\", the target service will use the certification file to perform a real health check to Providers such as Codex/xAI.";
"这里提供 API Key、Base URL、模型前缀、独立代理和流量权重。已有凭证编辑使用 PATCH，只提交实际改动；headers、模型映射等高级字段会被保留，可从完整配置继续调整。" = "API Key, Base URL, model prefix, independent proxy and traffic weight are provided here. Use PATCH to edit existing credentials and only submit actual changes; advanced fields such as headers and model mapping will be retained, and you can continue to adjust from the complete configuration.";
