"解压应用内置的网关包，初始化网关数据目录与内部引擎 Key" = "Unpack the gateway package the app carries and set up the gateway data directory and the internal engine key";
"验证引擎、CPA Manager Plus 与网关的本机健康检查" = "Verify the local health checks of the engine, CPA Manager Plus and the gateway";
