"目标上的 %@ 是 %@，比本应用要安装的 %@ 新；已拒绝降级，没有停止或修改任何内容。请先更新 Oases CPA 应用。" = "%@ on the target is %@, newer than %@ that this app would install. The downgrade was refused; nothing was stopped or changed. Update Oases CPA first.";
"Oases 网关只支持原生部署；Docker 部署只包含上游 CLIProxyAPI 与 CPA Manager Plus" = "The Oases gateway is available for native deployments only; a Docker deployment contains only the upstream CLIProxyAPI and CPA Manager Plus";
"升级到完整版（加入 Oases 网关）" = "Upgrade to the full edition (adds the Oases gateway)";
"升级到完整版？" = "Upgrade to the full edition?";
"App 会先把启动脚本、引擎配置和运行时备份到目标目录的 backups/upgrade-*，再安装 Node 与 Oases 网关。端口会迁移：CLIProxyAPI 从 8317 改到 18316，8317 改由 Oases 网关提供 /v1，网关管理口是 18320；SSH 隧道会按新端口重新建立。认证文件、客户端 Key 和 CPAMP 数据会保留，之后可以回滚。" = "The app first backs up the start scripts, the engine configuration and the runtimes to backups/upgrade-* in the target directory, then installs Node and the Oases gateway. The ports move: CLIProxyAPI goes from 8317 to 18316, the Oases gateway serves /v1 on 8317, and its admin port is 18320; the SSH tunnel is reopened with the new ports. Authentication files, client keys and CPAMP data are kept, and you can roll back later.";
"App 会先把启动脚本、版本记录、运行时和 gateway-data 备份到目标目录的 backups/upgrade-*，再升级到本应用固定的 CLIProxyAPI、CPA Manager Plus、Node 与 Oases 网关版本；目标上已有更新的版本时会拒绝降级。配置、认证文件和 CPAMP 数据会保留。" = "The app first backs up the start scripts, the versions record, the runtimes and gateway-data to backups/upgrade-* in the target directory, then upgrades to the CLIProxyAPI, CPA Manager Plus, Node and Oases gateway versions pinned by this app; it refuses to downgrade when the target already has a newer version. Configuration, authentication files and CPAMP data are kept.";
"App 会先保存 Compose 文件和版本记录到目标目录的 backups/upgrade-*，再拉取本应用固定的 CLIProxyAPI 与 CPA Manager Plus 镜像。Oases 网关只支持原生部署；Docker 部署只包含上游 CLIProxyAPI 与 CPA Manager Plus。" = "The app first saves the Compose file and the versions record to backups/upgrade-* in the target directory, then pulls the CLIProxyAPI and CPA Manager Plus images pinned by this app. The Oases gateway is available for native deployments only; a Docker deployment contains only the upstream CLIProxyAPI and CPA Manager Plus.";
"正在下载并切换到本应用固定的运行时版本…" = "Downloading and switching to the runtime versions pinned by this app...";
"停止 Oases 网关、CLIProxyAPI 与 CPAMP（网关先停，最多等待 30 秒让进行中的请求完成），不删除安装目录、认证文件或 Keychain 凭据。" = "Stops the Oases gateway, CLIProxyAPI and CPAMP (the gateway first, waiting up to 30 seconds for requests in progress) without deleting the install directory, authentication files or Keychain credentials.";
"将先停止 Oases 网关、CLIProxyAPI 与 CPAMP，再删除 %@ 中的全部文件、备份和日志（含网关数据），同时清除该目标的 Keychain 凭据与保存记录。此操作不可撤销。" = "First stops the Oases gateway, CLIProxyAPI and CPAMP, then deletes every file, backup and log in %@ (gateway data included) and clears this target's Keychain credentials and saved record. This cannot be undone.";
"将先停止 CLIProxyAPI 与 CPAMP，再删除 %@ 中的全部文件、备份和日志，同时清除该目标的 Keychain 凭据与保存记录。此操作不可撤销。" = "First stops CLIProxyAPI and CPAMP, then deletes every file, backup and log in %@ and clears this target's Keychain credentials and saved record. This cannot be undone.";
"App 会使用目标目录中最近的 backups/upgrade-*：启动脚本、版本记录、引擎配置（config.yaml）和 Oases 网关数据（gateway-data，如有）都回到升级前的状态；升级后较新的这些文件保留在该备份的 *.after-upgrade 与 gateway-data-after-upgrade 中，不会删除。随后重新验证 %@。认证文件和 CPAMP 数据不变。" = "The app uses the newest backups/upgrade-* in the target directory: the start scripts, the versions record, the engine configuration (config.yaml) and the Oases gateway data (gateway-data, if any) return to their state before the upgrade; the newer copies are kept inside that backup (*.after-upgrade and gateway-data-after-upgrade), not deleted. Then %@ are verified again. Authentication files and CPAMP data stay unchanged.";
"Oases 网关、CLIProxyAPI、CPAMP 和 SSH 隧道（如适用）均可访问；App 会每 30 秒自动检查" = "The Oases gateway, CLIProxyAPI, CPAMP, and SSH tunnels (if applicable) are all reachable; the app checks every 30 seconds";
